# The GFOpenBZip2 release The Powder Toy is built with and ships: its
# bzip2.library goes in the archive (ThePowderToy/Libs/, copied to LIBS: by
# the Installer), and its SDK's bzlib.h and libbz2.a are linked.
# package/bzip2.sh fetches and checks it.
GFOPENBZIP2_REPO=DalsinAI/gfopenbzip2
GFOPENBZIP2_TAG=v1.0-rc1
GFOPENBZIP2_ARCHIVE=GFOpenBZip2-1.0-rc1.lha
GFOPENBZIP2_SHA256=c8e84eb828f03f2d93c1e1bc21e802f27c6328f7aa192275d896f54d9b799e51
